| Module | Path |
| --- | --- |
| Receipt union | `src/domain/receipt.ts` |
| Privacy + sources | `src/domain/primitives.ts` |
| Slurp state | `src/domain/slurp.ts` |
| Topic prompts | `src/domain/topic.ts` |
| Search | `src/domain/search.ts` |
